{"content_hash": "ef4f27e845b9e46f", "version_id": 814, "article_id": 82, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "XPeng launches MONA L05 SUV from 139,800 yuan", "title_zh": "小鹏MONA L05上市，13.98万元起", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1686761?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720774401213-08da3073d9e2?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fG1vbmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzMyMjkyNnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Richard Multimedia on Unsplash", "author": "Richard Multimedia", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rmultimedia?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-crowd-of-people-standing-in-front-of-a-painting-WW4M24Z_yw4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(286, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(324, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "22de88a019f8"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-30", "word_count": 247, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "XPeng has added a third model to its MONA line, the L05, a five-seat SUV that starts at a limited-time price of 139,800 yuan. The company hopes to avoid the delivery delays that hurt its previous launch.", "lead_zh": "小鹏为MONA系列增添了第三款车型L05，这是一台大五座SUV，限时权益价13.98万元起。公司希望避免上一款车交付延迟带来的问题。", "preview": "The L05 went on sale with six versions, priced between 139,800 and 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026. XPeng", "preview_zh": "L05共推出六款车型，2026年12月15日24点前下定的用户可享受13.98万至17.18万元的价格。小鹏还提供前排座椅升级、20扬声器音响和专属车漆等免费权益。为避免重蹈L03交付慢被批评的覆辙，小鹏已提前量产5000台准现车，可直接交付。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 799, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 118.0, "size_bytes": 708912, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 120.3, "size_bytes": 722736, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 128.225, "size_bytes": 770256, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 109.7, "size_bytes": 659088, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 121.925, "size_bytes": 732528, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@42e9725/content/data/versions/814.json", "paragraphs": ["The L05 went on sale with six versions, priced between 139,800 and 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026. XPeng also offers free extras such as upgraded front seats, a 20-speaker audio system and special paint. To avoid repeating the problems of the L03, which was criticised for slow deliveries, XPeng has already built 5,000 cars ready to hand over.", "The car is 4,870mm long with a 2,940mm wheelbase, and XPeng calls it an AI smart five-seat SUV aimed at young buyers and young families. Inside, a 26.8-inch head-up display replaces the traditional instrument panel, and the cabin offers 22 mounting points for cameras and phones. The front passenger seat has a zero-gravity function, while the rear seats can recline electrically.", "Buyers can choose a pure electric version with a range of 535km, 560km or 635km, or a range-extender version that runs 310km on electricity alone and 1,310km in total. The boot holds 702 litres, rising to 1,913 litres with the rear seats folded. The MONA series has now delivered more than 360,000 cars, at an average of 14,000 a month.", "The L05 was designed for both left- and right-hand drive, and XPeng plans to sell it in 82 countries, entering Europe in early 2027. He Xiaopeng said 91% of MONA orders are for the advanced driver-assistance versions, and more than half of owners use the system every day. The top Ultra SE version carries two of XPeng's own Turing AI chips."], "paragraphs_zh": ["L05共推出六款车型，2026年12月15日24点前下定的用户可享受13.98万至17.18万元的价格。小鹏还提供前排座椅升级、20扬声器音响和专属车漆等免费权益。为避免重蹈L03交付慢被批评的覆辙，小鹏已提前量产5000台准现车，可直接交付。", "新车车长4870毫米，轴距2940毫米，小鹏称其为面向年轻人和年轻家庭的AI智能大五座SUV。车内用26.8英寸抬头显示取代传统仪表盘，全车预留22处拓展接口，方便固定相机和手机。副驾配备零重力座椅，后排座椅支持电动调节。", "消费者可选纯电版，续航分别为535公里、560公里和635公里；也可选超级增程版，纯电续航310公里，综合续航1310公里。后备厢容积702升，放倒后排可拓展至1913升。MONA系列累计交付已突破36万台，月均1.4万台。", "L05从立项起就同步开发左舵和右舵版本，小鹏计划在82个国家和地区销售，并于2027年初进入欧洲市场。何小鹏表示，MONA订单中91%为高阶智驾版，超过一半车主每天使用智驾。顶配Ultra SE搭载两颗自研图灵AI芯片。"], "body": "The L05 went on sale with six versions, priced between 139,800 and 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026. XPeng also offers free extras such as upgraded front seats, a 20-speaker audio system and special paint. To avoid repeating the problems of the L03, which was criticised for slow deliveries, XPeng has already built 5,000 cars ready to hand over.\n\nThe car is 4,870mm long with a 2,940mm wheelbase, and XPeng calls it an AI smart five-seat SUV aimed at young buyers and young families. Inside, a 26.8-inch head-up display replaces the traditional instrument panel, and the cabin offers 22 mounting points for cameras and phones. The front passenger seat has a zero-gravity function, while the rear seats can recline electrically.\n\nBuyers can choose a pure electric version with a range of 535km, 560km or 635km, or a range-extender version that runs 310km on electricity alone and 1,310km in total. The boot holds 702 litres, rising to 1,913 litres with the rear seats folded. The MONA series has now delivered more than 360,000 cars, at an average of 14,000 a month.\n\nThe L05 was designed for both left- and right-hand drive, and XPeng plans to sell it in 82 countries, entering Europe in early 2027. He Xiaopeng said 91% of MONA orders are for the advanced driver-assistance versions, and more than half of owners use the system every day. The top Ultra SE version carries two of XPeng's own Turing AI chips.", "body_zh": "L05共推出六款车型，2026年12月15日24点前下定的用户可享受13.98万至17.18万元的价格。小鹏还提供前排座椅升级、20扬声器音响和专属车漆等免费权益。为避免重蹈L03交付慢被批评的覆辙，小鹏已提前量产5000台准现车，可直接交付。\n\n新车车长4870毫米，轴距2940毫米，小鹏称其为面向年轻人和年轻家庭的AI智能大五座SUV。车内用26.8英寸抬头显示取代传统仪表盘，全车预留22处拓展接口，方便固定相机和手机。副驾配备零重力座椅，后排座椅支持电动调节。\n\n消费者可选纯电版，续航分别为535公里、560公里和635公里；也可选超级增程版，纯电续航310公里，综合续航1310公里。后备厢容积702升，放倒后排可拓展至1913升。MONA系列累计交付已突破36万台，月均1.4万台。\n\nL05从立项起就同步开发左舵和右舵版本，小鹏计划在82个国家和地区销售，并于2027年初进入欧洲市场。何小鹏表示，MONA订单中91%为高阶智驾版，超过一半车主每天使用智驾。顶配Ultra SE搭载两颗自研图灵AI芯片。", "text": "The L05 went on sale with six versions, priced between 139,800 and 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026. XPeng also offers free extras such as upgraded front seats, a 20-speaker audio system and special paint. To avoid repeating the problems of the L03, which was criticised for slow deliveries, XPeng has already built 5,000 cars ready to hand over. The car is 4,870mm long with a 2,940mm wheelbase, and XPeng calls it an AI smart five-seat SUV aimed at young buyers and young families. Inside, a 26.8-inch head-up display replaces the traditional instrument panel, and the cabin offers 22 mounting points for cameras and phones. The front passenger seat has a zero-gravity function, while the rear seats can recline electrically. Buyers can choose a pure electric version with a range of 535km, 560km or 635km, or a range-extender version that runs 310km on electricity alone and 1,310km in total. The boot holds 702 litres, rising to 1,913 litres with the rear seats folded. The MONA series has now delivered more than 360,000 cars, at an average of 14,000 a month. The L05 was designed for both left- and right-hand drive, and XPeng plans to sell it in 82 countries, entering Europe in early 2027. He Xiaopeng said 91% of MONA orders are for the advanced driver-assistance versions, and more than half of owners use the system every day. The top Ultra SE version carries two of XPeng's own Turing AI chips.", "vocab": [{"word": "limited-time price", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "限时价", "note": "常与 offer、discount 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "delivery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "交付", "note": "汽车行业常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wheelbase", "pos": "noun", "zh": "轴距", "note": "车身尺寸参数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "range", "pos": "noun", "zh": "续航里程", "note": "电动车核心指标", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "range extender", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "增程器", "note": "指用发动机发电的混动方案", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "boot", "pos": "noun", "zh": "后备厢", "note": "英式说法，美式为 trunk", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recline", "pos": "verb", "zh": "向后倾斜", "note": "常形容座椅靠背", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "driver-assistance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "驾驶辅助", "note": "智驾的正式说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rival", "pos": "noun", "zh": "竞争对手", "note": "可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "packaging", "pos": "noun", "zh": "空间布局", "note": "汽车语境指空间利用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flagship", "pos": "noun", "zh": "旗舰产品", "note": "常作定语，如 flagship model", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "avoid repeating", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "避免重蹈覆辙", "note": "后接名词或动名词", 